  "instance_name": "loyalty_warning_mapping",
  "label": "The wax figure of Tupac Shakur is mapped as the embodiment of the warning about betrayal.",
  "description": "The textual message 'u gotta be prepared for disloyal sh*t no matter how loyal u are to a person' is analogically mapped onto the visual entity of the Tupac Shakur wax figure. The figure, representing a cultural icon associated with loyalty and struggle, is used symbolically to anchor the cynical message about betrayal. This mapping leverages Tupac's legacy as a symbol of authenticity and vulnerability to deliver a warning about the fragility of loyalty in human relationships. The wax figure serves as the visual anchor for the abstract concept of 'preparedness for disloyalty' as described in the text.",
